OL,3,GNEWSAFour jailed over #13.8m
OL,4,Ainternational drug plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour members of an international drugs
OL,7,Fgang have been jailed after trying to
OL,8,Fsmuggle cannabis with a street value of
OL,9,F#13.8m into the UK from Thailand.
OL,11,FIt comes after 11 gang members were
OL,12,Farrested by border force officers at
OL,13,FBirmingham Airport in August 2024 when
OL,14,Fthe Class B drug was discovered packed
OL,15,Finto 22 suitcases, the National Crime
OL,16,FAgency (NCA) said.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
