OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFour jailed over #13.8m
OL,4,Ainternational drug plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigators said they had travelled
OL,7,Fto the UK from Thailand, via Charles de
OL,8,FGaulle Airport in Paris, and had to pay
OL,9,Fexcess baggage charges at Bangkok
OL,10,Fairport because of the weight of their
OL,11,Fsuitcases.
OL,13,FEach member was caught with two cases
OL,14,Fholding 20kg (44lb) of vacuum-packed
OL,15,Fcannabis below clothing, amounting to a
OL,16,Ftotal of 460kg (1,014lb).
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
